#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:1
msgid ""
"A simple guide to the first basic steps of using Krita: creating and saving an"
" image."
msgstr ""
"Krita erabiltzeko oinarrizko lehenengo urratsen gida erraz bat: irudiak "
"sortzea eta gordetzea."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:18
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Hastapenak"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:18
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Gorde"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:18
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Zamatu"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:18
msgid "New"
msgstr "Berria"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:22
msgid "Starting Krita"
msgstr "Krita abiatzea"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:24
msgid ""
"When you start Krita for the first time there will be no canvas or new documen"
"t open by default. You will be greeted by a :ref:`welcome screen <welcome_scre"
"en>`, which will have option to create a new file or open existing document. T"
"o create a new canvas you have to create a new document from the :guilabel:`Fi"
"le` menu or by clicking on :guilabel:`New File`  under start section of the we"
"lcome screen. This will open the new file dialog box. If you want to open an e"
"xisting image, either use :menuselection:`File --> Open...` or drag the image "
"from your computer into Krita's window."
msgstr ""
"Krita lehen aldiz abiatzen duzunean, era lehenetsian, ez da mihiserik edo "
"dokumentu berririk irekiko. :ref:`Ongi etorri pantaila <welcome_screen>`, "
"batek agurtuko zaitu, fitxategi berri bat sortzeko edo dagoen bat irekitzeko "
"aukera izango duena. Mihise berri bat sortzeko, dokumentu berri bat sortu "
"behar duzu :guilabel:`Fitxategi` menutik, edo Ongi etorri pantailako hasi "
"ataleko :guilabel:`Fitxategi berria`n klik eginez. Horrek fitxategi berria "
"elkarrizketa-koadroa irekiko du. Aurrez dagoen irudi bat ireki nahi baduzu, "
"erabili :menuselection:`Fitxategia --> Ireki...` edo arrastatu irudia zure "
"ordenagailutik Krita-ren leihora."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:30
msgid "Creating a New Document"
msgstr "Dokumentu berri bat sortzea"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:32
msgid "A new document can be created as follows."
msgstr "Dokumentu berri bat horrela sor daiteke."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:34
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`File` from the application menu at the top."
msgstr "Egin klik goiko aplikazio menuko :guilabel:`Fitxategia`n"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:35
msgid ""
"Then click on :guilabel:`New`. Or you can do this by pressing the :kbd:`Ctrl +"
" N` shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren egin klik :guilabel:`Berria`n. Edo :kbd:`Ktrl + N` lasterbidea sakatuz"
" "
"egin dezakezu."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:36
msgid "Now you will get a New Document dialog box as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"Behean erakusten den bezala, Dokumentu berria elkarrizketa-"
"koadro bat azalduko zaizu:"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:39
msgid ".. image:: images/Krita_newfile.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/Krita_newfile.png"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:40
msgid ""
"Click on the :guilabel:`Custom Document` section and in the :guilabel:`Dimensi"
"ons` tab choose A4 (300ppi) or any size that you prefer from the :guilabel:`Pr"
"edefined` drop down. To know more about the other sections such as create docu"
"ment from clipboard and templates see :ref:`create_new_document`."
msgstr ""
"Egin klik :guilabel:`Neurriko dokumentua` atalean eta :guilabel:`Dimentsioak` "
"fitxan, aukeratu A4 (300ppi) edo :guilabel:`aurredefinitutako` goitik beherako"
"tik "
"nahiago duzun neurria. Beste atalei buruz gehiago jakiteko, hala nola arbeleti"
"k "
"eta txantiloitik dokumentua sortzea, begiratu :ref:`create_new_document`."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:42
msgid ""
"Make sure that the color profile is RGB and depth is set to 8-bit integer/chan"
"nel in the color section. For advanced information about the color and color m"
"anagement refer to :ref:`general_concept_color`."
msgstr ""
"Kolore atalean kolore-profila RGB eta sakonera 8 bit oso/kanal dela ziurtatu. "
"Koloreari eta kolore-kudeaketari buruzko informazio aurreratua lortzeko, "
"ikusi :ref:`general_concept_color`."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:45
msgid "How to use brushes"
msgstr "Pintzelak nola erabili"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:47
msgid ""
"Now, on the blank white canvas, just left click with your mouse or draw with t"
"he pen on a graphic tablet. If everything's correct, you should be able to dra"
"w on the canvas! The brush tool should be selected by default when you start K"
"rita, but if for some reason it is not, you can click on this |toolfreehandbru"
"sh| icon from the toolbox and activate the brush tool."
msgstr ""
"Orain, mihise zuri hutsean, saguarekin ezkerreko klik egin edo arkatzarekin "
"tableta grafiko batean marraztea besterik ez duzu egin behar. Dena ondo "
"badago, mihisean marrazteko gai izan beharko zenuke! Krita abiatzen "
"duzunean, pintzel tresna hautatu beharko litzateke era lehenetsian, baina "
"edozer gauzagatik hala ez bada, tresna-kutxako ikono honetan "
"|toolfreehandbrush| klik egin dezakezu pintzel tresna aktibatzeko."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:49
msgid ""
"Of course, you'd want to use different brushes. On your right, there's a docke"
"r named Brush Presets (or on top, press the :kbd:`F6` key to find this one) wi"
"th all these cute squares with pens and crayons."
msgstr ""
"Jakina, pintzel ezberdinak erabili nahiko zenituzke. Zure eskuinean, Pintzel "
"aurrezarpenak izeneko zamaketari bat dago (edo goian, sakatu :kbd:`F6` "
"tekla hori aurkitzeko) bola-lumak eta margo-arkatzak dituzten lauki eder "
"guzti horiekin."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:51
msgid ""
"If you want to tweak the presets, check the Brush Editor in the toolbar. You c"
"an also access the Brush Editor with the :kbd:`F5` key."
msgstr ""
"Aurrezarpenak doitu nahi badituzu, frogatu tresna-barrako Pintzel-editorea. "
":kbd:`F5` teklarekin ere Pintzel-editorera irits zaitezke."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:54
msgid ".. image:: images/dockers/Krita_Brush_Preset_Docker.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/dockers/Krita_Brush_Preset_Docker.png"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:55
msgid ""
"Tick any of the squares to choose a brush, and then draw on the canvas. To cha"
"nge color, click the triangle in the Advanced Color Selector docker."
msgstr ""
"Markatu edozein karratu pintzel bat hautatzeko, eta ondoren, mihisean "
"marraztu. Kolorea aldatzeko, Kolore-hautatzaile aurreratua zamatzaileko "
"triangeluan klik egin."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:58
msgid "Erasing"
msgstr "Ezabatzea"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:60
msgid ""
"There are brush presets for erasing, but it is often faster to use the eraser "
"toggle. By toggling the :kbd:`E` key, your current brush switches between eras"
"ing and painting. This erasing method works with most of the tools. You can er"
"ase using the line tool, rectangle tool, and even the gradient tool."
msgstr ""
"Ezabatzeko pintzel aurrezarpenak daude, baina ezabatzekoa txandakatzea "
"askotan azkarragoa izaten da. :kbd:`E` tekla txandakatuz, uneko zure pintzela "
"ezabatzea eta margotzea artean aldatzen du. Ezabatzeko metodo hau tresna "
"gehienekin dabil. Lerro tresna, laukizuzen tresna, eta baita gradiente tresna "
"erabiliz ere ezaba dezakezu."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:63
msgid "Saving and opening files"
msgstr "Fitxategiak gordetzea eta irekitzea"

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:65
msgid ""
"Now, once you have figured out how to draw something in Krita, you may want to"
" save it. The save option is in the same place as it is in all other computer "
"programs: the top-menu of :guilabel:`File`, and then :guilabel:`Save`. Select "
"the folder you want to have your drawing, and select the file format you want "
"to use (``.kra`` is Krita's default format, and will save everything). And the"
"n hit :guilabel:`Save`. Some older versions of Krita have a bug and require yo"
"u to manually type the extension."
msgstr ""
"Orain, Krita-n zerbait nola marraztu ulertu duzula, baliteke egindakoa gorde "
"nahi izatea. Gordetzeko aukera ordenagailuko beste programa guztietan egoten "
"den leku berean dago, goiko menuko :guilabel:`Fitxategia` aukeran, eta haren "
"barruko :guilabel:`Gorde` sarreran. Aukeratu zure marrazkia gordetzeko karpeta"
", "
"eta erabili nahi duzun formatua (``.kra`` Krita-ren formatu lehenetsia da, den"
"a "
"gordeko duena). Gero sakatu :guilabel:`Gorde`. Krita-ren bertsio zaharrago bat"
"zuk "
"akats bat dute eta luzapena eskuz tekleatzea eskatzen dute."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:67
msgid ""
"If you want to show off your image on the internet, check out the :ref:`saving"
"_for_the_web` tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Zure irudia Interneten erakutsi nahi baduzu, begiratu :ref:`saving_for_the_"
"web` tutoretza."

#: ../../user_manual/getting_started/starting_krita.rst:69
msgid ""
"Check out :ref:`navigation` for further basic information, :ref:`basic_concept"
"s` for an introduction as Krita as a medium, or just go out and explore Krita!"
msgstr ""
"Begiratu :ref:`navigation` oinarrizko informazio gehiago lortzeko, "
":ref:`basic_concepts` euskarri gisa Krita-ren sarrera bat izateko, edo "
"besterik gabe irten eta Krita esploratu!"
